(7806664, 1302917, 12200, '<td valign="top">
<table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by posthumous:</b></div><hr/><i> the shadow of the phone suggests it''s another tool. </i></td></tr></table>
<br/>
<br/>That''s exactly what I was going for -- I''m tickled that it came through. I would have been content to leave myself out of the shadow, but I felt like I needed enough of my torso to convey that the what you''re seeing is a hand holding a phone and not some other random tool. So this is something of a commentary on way digital "ordinary tools" have in many ways supplanted but not completely replaced reliable, analog ones like these. :-)
<br/>
<br/>Then again, maybe the biggest "tool" in this image IS me? :-P</td>', 'Originally posted by posthumous: the shadow of the phone suggests it''s another tool. 

That''s exactly what I was going for -- I''m tickled that it came through. I would have been content to leave myself out of the shadow, but I felt like I needed enough of my torso to convey that the what you''re seeing is a hand holding a phone and not some other random tool. So this is something of a commentary on way digital "ordinary tools" have in many ways supplanted but not completely replaced reliable, analog ones like these. :-)

Then again, maybe the biggest "tool" in this image IS me? :-P', '2026-01-05 12:51:34.000000', NULL, 0),
